# The Simplified Technical English backlog. IT IS NOW EMPTY.
#
# `vale lint` skips the paths listed here. Every page under docs/ passes the
# ASD-STE100 gate, so nothing is listed and every page is checked.
#
# Keep this file. Its emptiness is the point: adding a line is how you park a
# page you have not rewritten yet, and an empty list says there are none.
#
# If you find yourself adding a line, prefer fixing the page. The whole backlog
# was 76 pages, 219 errors and 343 warnings, and it came down page by page.
#
# The standard is docs-redesign/08-simplified-technical-english.md.
# The config, including the permanent exemptions, is .vale-ste.yml.
